                <span class="group-label">Group B</span>
                <strong>Learning-stage camera</strong>
                <span>Camera introduced as learners began learning the meanings of the words.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="experiment-cell">
                <span class="group-label">Group C</span>
                <strong>Output-stage camera</strong>
                <span>Camera introduced when learners had to produce the French word from an English prompt.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="experiment-cell">
